  "description": "Background worker and bounded in-memory queue for the RubiconMp document processing pipeline. Supports legacy .NET Framework 4.6.2–4.8.1 apps (including Windows Services) as well as .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 10. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
